{"page":"RPA2","gene":"RPA2","accession":"P15927","protein":"Replication protein A 32 kDa subunit","length":270,"events":["Alternative splicing"],"canonical":{"accession":"P15927-1","name":"1","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000373912.8"],"refseq":["NM_002946.5"],"refseqProteins":["NP_002937.1"],"maneSelect":true,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"model":{"entry":"AF-P15927-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P15927-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":79.3,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,1],[0,18],[50,1],[0,1],[50,1],[0,5],[50,2],[0,9],[50,5],[70,1],[90,14],[70,3],[90,3],[70,7],[90,14],[70,1],[90,20],[70,4],[50,5],[70,2],[90,16],[70,1],[90,1],[70,1],[90,28],[70,6],[50,4],[0,9],[50,1],[0,12],[50,5],[70,5],[90,12],[70,1],[90,15],[70,1],[90,31],[70,1],[50,1],[0,1]]}},"features":[{"type":"Modified residue","start":1,"end":1,"description":"N-acetylmethionine"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":4,"end":4,"description":"Phosphoserine; by PRKDC"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":8,"end":8,"description":"Phosphoserine; by PRKDC"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":21,"end":21,"description":"Phosphothreonine; by PRKDC"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":23,"end":23,"description":"Phosphoserine; by CDK2"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":29,"end":29,"description":"Phosphoserine; by CDK1"},{"type":"Modified residue","start":33,"end":33,"description":"Phosphoserine; by PRKDC"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":37,"end":37,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in ubiquitin)"},{"type":"Cross-link","start":38,"end":38,"description":"Glycyl lysine isopeptide (Lys-Gly) (interchain with G-Cter in ubiquitin)"},{"type":"DNA binding","start":74,"end":148,"description":"OB"},{"type":"Region","start":187,"end":270,"description":"Interaction with RAD52, TIPIN, UNG and XPA"}],"interfaces":{"POLA2":[81,123,247,250,251,252,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,266,267,268],"RPA1":[44,45,46,47,48,73,127,129,144,145,147,151,153,154,157,160,161,163,164,165,167,168,169,171],"RPA3":[50,52,53,55,56,58,66,67,79,81,95,96,97,98,99,100,101,123,124,125,149,150,151,152,153,155,156,159,160,162,163,166,167,170]},"subunit":[{"topic":"Subunit","text":"Component of the replication protein A complex (RPA/RP-A), a heterotrimeric complex composed of RPA1, RPA2 and RPA3 (PubMed:10449415, PubMed:19116208, PubMed:2406247). Interacts with PRPF19; the PRP19-CDC5L complex is recruited to the sites of DNA repair where it ubiquitinates the replication protein A complex (RPA) (PubMed:24332808). Interacts with SERTAD3 (PubMed:10982866). Interacts with TIPIN (PubMed:17141802, PubMed:17296725). Interacts with TIMELESS (PubMed:17141802). Interacts with PPP4R2; the interaction is direct, DNA damage-dependent and mediates the recruitment of the PP4 catalytic subunit PPP4C (PubMed:20154705). Interacts (hyperphosphorylated) with RAD51 (PubMed:20154705). Interacts with SMARCAL1; the interaction is direct and mediates the recruitment to the RPA complex of SMARCAL1 (PubMed:19793861, PubMed:19793862, PubMed:19793863, PubMed:24910198). Interacts with RAD52 and XPA; those interactions are direct and associate RAD52 and XPA to the RPA complex (PubMed:11081631, PubMed:17765923, PubMed:7700386, PubMed:8702565). Interacts with FBH1 (PubMed:23319600). Interacts with ETAA1; the interaction is direct and promotes ETAA1 recruitment at stalled replication forks (PubMed:27601467, PubMed:27723717, PubMed:27723720). Interacts with RFWD3 (PubMed:21504906, PubMed:21558276, PubMed:26474068, PubMed:28575657). Interacts with DDI2 (PubMed:29290612). Interacts (in unphosphorylated form via N-terminus) with EIF4EBP3; the interaction enhances EIF4EBP3-mediated inhibition of EIF4E-mediated mRNA nuclear export (PubMed:22684010). Interacts with BRIP1/FANCJ via the RPA1 subunit; following DNA damage they colocalize in foci in the nucleus (PubMed:17596542). Interacts with nuclear UNG (isoform 2); this interaction mediates UNG recruitment to RPA-coated single-stranded DNA at stalled replication forks"}],"isoforms":[{"accession":"P15927-2","name":"2","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":278,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000373909.7"],"refseq":["NM_001297558.1"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001284487.1"],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,1],[13,5,266]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":4,"original":"MWNS","replacement":"MGRGDRNKRSIR","added":12}],"missing":0,"replaced":3,"novel":11,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[[1,0,1]],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-P15927-2-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P15927-2-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":79.7,"plddt":[[0,1],[50,1],[0,2],[50,3],[0,1],[50,1],[0,4],[50,1],[0,11],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,1],[50,1],[0,5],[50,3],[0,9],[50,3],[70,2],[90,16],[70,1],[90,9],[70,1],[90,35],[70,4],[50,5],[70,2],[90,18],[70,1],[90,34],[70,3],[50,3],[0,3],[50,1],[0,16],[50,5],[70,5],[90,60],[70,1],[50,1],[0,1]],"losingConfidence":0}},{"accession":"P15927-3","name":"3","synonyms":[],"notes":[],"length":358,"transcripts":{"ensembl":["ENST00000313433.11"],"refseq":[],"refseqProteins":[],"maneSelect":false,"decay":[],"onlyDecay":false},"segments":[[1,1,4],[93,5,266]],"edits":[{"start":1,"end":4,"original":"MWNS","replacement":"MWNSNDGGAGWRRKRIAGGFSKRASLGSERRVVAGEEGRE","added":92}],"missing":0,"replaced":0,"novel":88,"foldedAbsent":0,"foldedMissing":0,"features":[],"interfaces":{},"model":{"entry":"AF-P15927-3-F1","cif":"https://alphafold.ebi.ac.uk/files/AF-P15927-3-F1-model_v6.cif","meanPlddt":69.9,"plddt":[[0,74],[50,17],[0,19],[50,1],[0,1],[50,2],[0,4],[50,1],[0,10],[50,3],[70,1],[90,15],[70,2],[90,4],[70,2],[90,3],[70,1],[90,35],[70,4],[50,5],[70,2],[90,18],[70,1],[90,32],[70,4],[50,3],[0,22],[50,5],[70,4],[90,11],[70,4],[90,12],[70,3],[90,30],[70,1],[50,1],[0,1]],"losingConfidence":0}}],"ensemblGenes":["ENSG00000117748.11"],"unmapped":{"ensembl":[],"refseq":["NM_001286076.2"],"refseqProteins":["NP_001273005.1"]},"coding":{"genes":1,"gencode":9,"mapped":3},"explorer":{"gene":